  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "How to read this",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 6
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "**Ranking uses outcomes only** — first-pass CI rate, change-failure (reverted) rate, fix-up rate,\nlead time to a green default-branch build, CI task failure rate — combined into `outcome_score`\n(0–100; a missing metric counts as the team value, i.e. neutral). `why` names the two strongest and\nthe weakest metric against the team. Contributors with fewer than `$min_commits` commits in the\nwindow get no rank. A contributor's commits = those they authored ∪ those they assisted (`Assisted-by:`).\n\n**Activity is context, not merit**: commits, lines, active days and CI runs are in their own table,\nsorted by name, and feed no score.\n\n**Attribution**: `Assisted-by:` trailers are enforced from `enforcedSince` on. Earlier history is\n*legacy*: \"no trailer\" proves nothing there, so a human-authored legacy commit without trailers is\n**unknown (pre-attribution)** — never counted as human.",
        "code": {
          "language": "plaintext",
          "showLineNumbers": false,
          "showMiniMap": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "type": "row",
      "title": "Ranking — outcome metrics only",
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 6,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 1
      },
      "panels": []
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "type": "table",
      "title": "Scorecard (ranked by outcome_score)",
      "description": "Only sample_ok rows are ranked (dense rank by outcome_score).",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "grafana-postgresql-datasource",
        "uid": "insights"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 7,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 12
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "grafana-postgresql-datasource",
            "uid": "insights"
          },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "format": "table",
          "rawQuery": true,
          "rawSql": "SELECT rank, contributor, kind, outcome_score,\n       first_pass_rate, change_failure_rate, fixup_rate, lead_time_h, task_failure_rate,\n       sample_ok, why\nFROM scorecard($__timeFrom(), $__timeTo(), $min_commits::int)\nORDER BY rank NULLS LAST, outcome_score DESC NULLS LAST, contributor"
        }
      ],
